{"__typename": "Tweet", "favorite_count": 0, "lang": "en", "possibly_sensitive": false, "created_at": "2026-09-30T22:42:03.000Z", "display_text_range": [0, 269], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.ai/bot/FdogFaBe5Y\u2026", "expanded_url": "https://x.ai/bot/FdogFaBe5Y2LWMc-bmsAg", "indices": [246, 269], "url": "https://t.co/FyRrOeAFCf"}]}, "id_str": "2105427985130283206", "text": "Ok. My Outsrc bot is finally on the exchange.  Now I just tell my Grok Bot to outsource the task to my local Claude Code/Codex/Grok Build.  Now I can leverage different models/efforts and offset my Grok Bot usage with usage from my other subs. \n\nhttps://t.co/FyRrOeAFCf", "user": {"id_str": "282621762", "name": "Edward Tadros", "screen_name": "edtadros", "is_blue_verified": true, "profile_image_shape": "Circle", "verified": false, "profile_image_url_https": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046426855235100673/T7pFRK3O_normal.jpg"}, "edit_control": {"edit_tweet_ids": ["2105427985130283206"], "editable_until_msecs": "1790811723000", "edits_remaining": "5", "is_edit_eligible": true}, "conversation_count": 1, "news_action_type": "conversation", "quoted_tweet": {"favorite_count": 2, "lang": "en", "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0, "created_at": "2026-09-30T20:37:43.000Z", "display_text_range": [0, 275], "entities": {"user_mentions": [{"id_str": "745629067874017280", "indices": [55, 63], "name": "Blender \ud83d\udd36", "screen_name": "Blender"}]}, "id_str": "2105396695886708981", "text": "Last week I wanted to know what all the fuss was about @Blender, so I downloaded it and needed something to do with it.  Well, at the same time I was working on a utility to allow my Grok Bot to use my local Claude Code, Codex, and Grok Build (oddly on a different sub).  And", "user": {"id_str": "282621762", "name": "Edward Tadros", "screen_name": "edtadros", "is_blue_verified": true, "profile_image_shape": "Circle", "verified": false, "profile_image_url_https": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_imag